---
// Stats section component - walk-forward validated strategy metrics.
// All numbers come from the out-of-sample study in docs/M4_EDGE_VALIDATION.md.
---

<section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-dark-900">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        Backtest-Validated Edge
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Our strategy is validated walk-forward: parameters fitted in-sample per fold,
        metrics reported out-of-sample only, fees and slippage included.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Strategy Performance (out-of-sample) -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-profit-50 to-primary-50 dark:from-profit-900/20 dark:to-primary-900/20 p-8 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-profit-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">TradePulse Strategy</h3>
            <p class="text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400 font-medium">EMA 20/100, BTC 1d, long-only</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">1.11</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Out-of-Sample Sharpe</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">&minus;49%</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Max Drawdown</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">4/4</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Fold Layouts Beat Buy &amp; Hold</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">36</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">OOS Trades (~6.5 years)</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-profit-100 dark:bg-profit-900/30 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-profit-700 dark:text-profit-300 font-medium">
              Paper trading live since 2026-07-16
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Buy & Hold benchmark (same data, same costs) -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-loss-50 to-gray-50 dark:from-loss-900/20 dark:to-gray-900/20 p-8 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-loss-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Buy &amp; Hold BTC</h3>
            <p class="text-loss-600 dark:text-loss-400 font-medium">Benchmark, same test windows</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-loss-600 dark:text-loss-400">0.87</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Out-of-Sample Sharpe</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-loss-600 dark:text-loss-400">&minus;77%</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Max Drawdown</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-loss-600 dark:text-loss-400">0/4</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Fold Layouts Won</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-loss-600 dark:text-loss-400">100%</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Time in Market</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-loss-100 dark:bg-loss-900/30 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-loss-600 dark:text-loss-400 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 17h8m0 0V9m0 8l-8-8-4 4-6-6" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-loss-700 dark:text-loss-300 font-medium">
              Rides every bear market to the bottom
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Walk-forward results by fold layout (full table from the study) -->
    <div class="mt-12 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-dark-800 rounded-lg p-6 overflow-x-auto">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 text-center">
        Walk-Forward Results by Fold Layout (BTC 1d, out-of-sample)
      </h3>
      <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            <th class="text-left py-2 px-3">Fold layout (train/test bars)</th>
            <th class="text-right py-2 px-3">Strategy Sharpe</th>
            <th class="text-right py-2 px-3">Buy &amp; Hold Sharpe</th>
            <th class="text-right py-2 px-3">Strategy MaxDD</th>
            <th class="text-right py-2 px-3">Buy &amp; Hold MaxDD</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
            <td class="py-2 px-3">730 / 180</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-semibold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">1.11</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">0.87</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;49%</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;77%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
            <td class="py-2 px-3">500 / 125</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-semibold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">1.14</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">0.97</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;50%</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;77%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
            <td class="py-2 px-3">1000 / 250</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-semibold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">1.12</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">1.00</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;50%</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;77%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-2 px-3">365 / 90</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-semibold text-profit-600 dark:text-profit-400">1.18</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">0.81</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;43%</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right">&minus;77%</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        * Walk-forward, out-of-sample backtest on Binance BTCUSDT daily data through 2026
        (next-bar-open execution, 0.1% fees + 0.02% slippage per side). Paper trading live since
        2026-07-16. Past performance does not guarantee future results. All trading involves risk;
        the platform currently trades virtual portfolios only.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
